        "pseudocode": "Input: f : Fin N \u2192 Fin N\n1. R = |{f(0), ..., f(N-1)}|  // O(N) with hash set\n2. loss = log(N) - log(R)      // O(1)\n3. Return (loss, R == N)",
        "code": "from algorithms import EntropyCalculator\nimport numpy as np\n\ncalc = EntropyCalculator()\nf_bij = np.array([2, 0, 3, 1])\nf_nonbij = np.array([0, 0, 1, 1])\nprint(f\"Bijective: loss={calc.uniform_entropy_loss(f_bij)}\")\nprint(f\"Non-bij: loss={calc.uniform_entropy_loss(f_nonbij)}\")",
